ything Is Coherent", "title": "Records Pass: oracle set covered (data-model.md, observability-strategy.md, security-model.md)", "recommendation": "Each new claim was checked against the code. The two ETag rows match the new unlink-first order. The tv.token_file_open row names the right method, level and field. security-model.md's 'Kept private two ways', the 0600 secrets-at-rest line, the unit-hardening paragraph (UMask added, the remaining directives still absent) and the two named tests all exist and hold. No governed_by dispositions apply, because no plan is bound. Nothing reaches a bar.", "oid": "O-4"}, {"goal": "Decisions Were Deliberate", "title": "No build plan claims this branch", "recommendation": "The manifest scope is unbound. The work traces to GitHub issues #3 and #4, cited in both commits and in the dated deploy/README section, so goal-checking was done against those issue titles as the commits state them.", "oid": "O-5"}], "duration_seconds": 420, "scope": null, "scope_chosen_by": "none", "scope_unresolved_cause": "unbound", "scope_reason": "no live plan claims `fix/token-mode-and-stale-etag`", "base_extended_from": null, "chunks": [], "chunks_proposed": [], "chunk": null, "base_reviewed": "d22b81119bac2ba7265a9e8b709dd3c6557ab99c", "record_lint": {"records": [".prawduct/artifacts/data-model.md", ".prawduct/artifacts/observability-strategy.md", ".prawduct/artifacts/security-model.md", "deploy/README.md"], "chunk_graded": null, "chunks_graded": [], "plan_graded": null, "findings": [], "unchecked": [], "counts": {"chunk-ref-missing": null, "governed-by-gap": 0, "suite-total-claim": 0, "learnings-over-budget": 0, "learnings-budget-unreasoned": 0, "learnings-core-raise-unapproved": 0, "learnings-rule-too-long": 0, "learnings-rule-body": 0, "learnings-area-dead": 0, "change-fragment": 0, "retired-claim-survives": 0}}, "dispatched_at": "2026-11-11T16:52:13Z", "tree_changed_during_review": {"paths": [".prawduct/owner-rulings.md"], "reason": "Deleted the untr